#: frontend/templates/index.html:4
msgid "Cyber security and fraud hub - HSBC HK"
msgstr "網絡安全及防詐騙資訊中心 - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:9
msgid "Cyber security and fraud hub"
msgstr "網絡安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:10
msgid ""
"HSBC Reminder: If you've lost your Credit/Debit card or believe it might "
"have been stolen or misused, you can temporarily suspend it via the HSBC "
"HK Mobile Banking App or HSBC Online Banking. You can also unblock it "
"when you think it’s safe or recovered."
msgstr "滙豐提示：為保障信用卡安全，如果您遺失信用卡/扣賬卡，或懷疑該卡可能被盗用，您可透過香港滙豐流動理財應用程式或滙豐網上理財暫時封鎖信用卡/扣賬卡。當您認為安全時，您亦可自行解鎖。"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:11
msgid ""
"You can now monitor designated activities performed on HSBC HK App, HSBC "
"Online Banking, HSBC Reward+ and HSBC Easy Invest with the"
msgstr "為讓您更易發現可疑的戶口動態，我們現於HSBC HK App為您提供特定指示或交易的"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:11 frontend/templates/index.html:22
msgid "activity log"
msgstr "使用紀錄"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:11
msgid "in the HSBC HK App, and identify any suspicious activity more easily."
msgstr "，當中包括HSBC HK App、滙豐網上理財、滙豐Reward+及香港滙豐投資全速易的相關紀錄。"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:12
msgid "You may be required to"
msgstr "若我們偵測到可疑動態，您可能需要進行"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:12
msgid "verify your identity"
msgstr "身分驗證"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:12
msgid ""
"if we detect any suspicious activity. You'll see a page / message about "
"it on the HSBC HK App. We'll also notify you via SMS and email."
msgstr "，而您亦會於HSBC HK App看到通知頁面或提示及收到我們相關的短訊及電郵。"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:13
msgid ""
"Beware of cheque scams. Fraudsters may deposit invalid cheques to claim "
"that you have been paid, as reflected in the increased ‘ledger balance‘ "
"in your account. Cheque deposit takes 1 to 2 working days for clearance. "
"Always check your ‘available balance‘ to confirm the payment is "
"completed."
msgstr "慎防支票詐騙。騙徒或會透過存入無效支票令您的戶口「賬面結餘」增加，從而聲稱已向您完成付款。請留意，存入支票後需1至2個工作天才完成結算，謹記檢查清楚戶口「可用結餘」以確認已收妥款項。"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:13 frontend/templates/index.html:16
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "了解更多"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:14
msgid ""
"Protect your Personal Digital Keys; Beware of Fraudulent Links! Visit the"
" HKMA website to learn more about Personal Digital Keys and security "
"tips, and watch their"
msgstr "數碼KEY睇緊啲，撳LINK前要三思！請前往香港金融管理局網站了解更多關於個人數碼鑰匙及安全提示，並睇緊他們的"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:14
msgid "educational video"
msgstr "教育短片"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:14
msgid "(Chinese only)."
msgstr "（只限中文）"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:15
msgid "SECURITY NOTICE:"
msgstr "網絡保安提示："

#: frontend/templates/index.html:15
msgid ""
"HSBC HK is not affiliated with any third party aggregator mobile apps and"
" for security reasons customers should not disclose their online banking "
"credentials, especially one-time security code generated by your Security"
" Device / Mobile Security Key, to third parties."
msgstr "滙豐沒有與任何第三方戶口整合應用程式有任何聯繫，基於安全考慮，客戶不應向任何第三方透露其網上銀行個人認證資料，特別是使用保安編碼器／流動保安編碼產生的一次性保安編碼。"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:16
msgid ""
"Look out for malwares that can take over your phone. Never grant full "
"control of your phone or sensitive permissions for accessibility or "
"debugging unless you’re certain. These permissions may cause potential "
"security risks."
msgstr "提防不法之徒透過惡意軟件掌控您的手機。如無法確認其來源可信，請勿隨意授予手機的完整控制權或敏感權限，包括無障礙功能及偵錯功能。開啓過多權限或導致潛在安全風險。"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:17
msgid "New safety measure in the Android version of the HSBC HK App"
msgstr "Android版本HSBC HK App的全新安全措施"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:18
msgid ""
"Learn more on how we protect you from malware with our new safety measure"
" in the Android version of the HSBC HK App."
msgstr "了解Android版本HSBC HK App的全新安全措施如何保護您免受惡意軟件侵害。"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:18
msgid "Find out more"
msgstr "了解更多"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:19
msgid "Money Safe"
msgstr "「智安存」"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:20
msgid ""
"Our new fraud prevention feature to protect your deposit accounts from "
"fraudsters."
msgstr "我們已推出全新的詐騙預防措施，保障您的存款戶口免受騙徒侵害。"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:20
msgid "Money Safe Interim Measure"
msgstr "「智安存」暫行措施"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:21
msgid "Empowering you to review your account activities"
msgstr "助您及時掌握戶口動態"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:22
msgid "Learn more on how the"
msgstr "了解HSBC HK App上的"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:22
msgid ""
"in the HSBC HK App will facilitate you to detect suspicious activities "
"easier and earlier. Alternatively, review selected activities now through"
" HSBC HK App &gt; Profile &gt; Activity Log."
msgstr "如何幫您更方便快捷地發現可疑的使用情況。您亦可直接到HSBC HK App > 「個人」分頁 > 使用紀錄 查看相關使用詳情。"

#: frontend/templates/index.html:23
msgid "Fraud prevention tips and steps"
msgstr "我們一直致力推廣網絡安全，本資訊中心為您提供一系列網絡安全措施及防詐騙錦囊，助您提高相關知識，保障您的金錢及個人資料安全。"

